    "body": "Pre-claim dependency check: #2620 is still claimed and has no open PR. Its latest progress comment says the implementation is held on issue/2620-gpu-compute-seam at 90c98be93632381f447e8d07abe89bf21b67dcd5, with the final gate still owed.\n\nUpstream main f3b0e195503466db86b0ff0b15dbf614153e1bb4 has no crates/gpu. #2621 needs that compute seam and its app dependency. The permitted stack workflow needs an open parent PR, so there is no eligible parent yet.\n\nStopped before claiming. No code or tests changed. Resume when #2620 has an eligible open PR to stack on or has merged.\n",
